<title>POLAND: Indykpol Q1 net rises to PLN 1.4 mln.</title>
<headline>Indykpol Q1 net rises to PLN 1.4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indykpol preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 2.85 vs	1.95</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   2.29 vs	1.06</p>
<p>    net profit				 1.42 vs	0.71</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Indykpol SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 35.50 vs	29.61</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  28.23 vs	24.59</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		    na  vs	 na</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.86 vs	 0.35</p>
<p>    other taxes				 na  vs	 na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.04 vs	 0.03</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.60 vs	 0.91</p>
<p>    investment				 0.73 vs	 0.48</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
